                      skip the flex_attention warmup on sm_121;
                      register the FirstBlockCache node and batched VAE patch.
  sol_attn/interface.py   route sm_121 to the Triton kernel path (2 sites).
  sol_attn_loader.py      report sm_121 as supported; name it GB10 / DGX Spark.
  minimax_h3_patch.py     force the Triton backend on sm_121 -- torch
